  "prefLabel": "Per 102.19 Candidate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.19 “Candidate” means an applicant whose application for employment is certified as meeting the minimum qualifications of the broad group specification and supplemental job description of the position for which the applicant has applied.\n\nSource. #5373, eff 4-27-92; ss by #6729, eff 4-21-98; ss by #10801, eff 5-17-15; renumbered by #13667 (formerly Per 102.11); renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.16), eff 12-1-25",
